{"title":"Steam Deck","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"steam-gift-cards","title":"Steam Gift Cards","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou may receive the codes on a printed receipt, not as a card as shown in the picture\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSteam Has thousands of games from Action to Indie and everything in-between. Enjoy exclusive deals, automatic game updates and other great perks. Meet new people, join game groups, form clans, chat in-game and more! With over 100 million potential friends (or enemies), the fun never stops.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gift Cards","offers":[{"title":"10$","offer_id":33326546288717,"sku":"","price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"20$","offer_id":33326546354253,"sku":"","price":22.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"50$","offer_id":33326546452557,"sku":"","price":53.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"100$","offer_id":39291533033549,"sku":"","price":103.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_1612816872580.jpg?v=1687050055"},{"product_id":"dobe-transparent-protective-case-for-steam-deck-ty-2835","title":"Dobe Transparent Protective Case For Steam Deck (TY-2835)","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"shopify-section-product-template\" class=\"shopify-section\"\u003e\n\u003csection data-section-id=\"product-template\" data-section-type=\"product\" data-section-settings='{\n  \"showShippingEstimator\": false,\n  \"showQuantitySelector\": true,\n  \"showPaymentButton\": false,\n  \"showInventoryQuantity\": true,\n  \"lowInventoryThreshold\": 0,\n  \"galleryTransitionEffect\": \"fade\",\n  \"enableImageZoom\": true,\n  \"zoomEffect\": \"outside\",\n  \"enableVideoLooping\": false,\n  \"productOptions\": [\"Title\"],\n  \"enableHistoryState\": true,\n  \"infoOverflowScroll\": true,\n  \"isQuickView\": false\n}'\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"container container--flush\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-block-list__item product-block-list__item--description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"card\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"card__section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rte text--pull\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"desc\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor Steam Deck\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"desc\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProduct name: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProtective Case\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"jianjie\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProduct model: TY-2835\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Dobe Transparent Protective Case for the Steam Deck is a great way to keep your device safe and protected. The case is made of a durable plastic that will keep your device safe from scratches.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666002707.jpg?v=1676088220\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666006792.jpg?v=1676088230\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666006387.jpg?v=1676088240\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666000057.jpg?v=1676088254\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666002497.jpg?v=1676088265\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0355\/8296\/7943\/files\/1666003081.jpg?