,"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1685482213133.jpg?v=1685482360"},{"product_id":"dobe-protective-cover-for-steam-deck-shock-absorption-anti-scratch-design","title":"Dobe Protective Cover for Steam Deck Shock-Absorption Anti-Scratch Design","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"9znqh8-7h2yek-of1ovl-cn0qi\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-14\" data-csa-c-id=\"xfd6m5-ao085d-h22ls6-nys4nw\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-14-card0\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"aplus-header-class\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"case\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/caf86cb3-790a-4ddb-a3b1-878b5a72215b.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/caf86cb3-790a-4ddb-a3b1-878b5a72215b.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"rkltdd-k45rzw-7u3kvi-f2tv7h\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"u5zc10-tfzb4p-1krgg8-7zyrjc\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"case\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/57513c74-546c-49d7-9f54-ccb587f0857f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/57513c74-546c-49d7-9f54-ccb587f0857f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"pbu49-opar07-e1dhyd-6ft820\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"case\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/31d7b6e5-a5b9-4e2b-9067-4cc4a80fcd53.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/31d7b6e5-a5b9-4e2b-9067-4cc4a80fcd53.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"c6n6sc-l6qase-skowea-vxhgvm\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"case\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/33bd1bcd-ecc4-449e-a964-ef19d3b94ae8.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/33bd1bcd-ecc4-449e-a964-ef19d3b94ae8.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44209685725406,"sku":"","price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1685482677381.jpg?v=1685483031"},{"product_id":"valve-steam-deck-oled-1tb","title":"Valve Steam Deck OLED - 1TB","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStunning HDR OLED display Immerse yourself in the gaming world with the HDR OLED display revealing brighter whites and richer blacks. Designed for gaming enthusiasts, the striking contrast, brilliant clarity, and larger screen size redefine your gameplay, bringing vivid colors and motion to life. Anti-glare technology The 1TB model features anti-glare etched glass, setting a new level of eye comfort for gamers. The game seamlessly in both bright and dim lighting without distracting glares and reflections. Adding a layer of sophistication to the device, the glass provides a premium touch to your gaming sessions. Bonus carrying case The 1TB models come bundled with a carrying case that features a removable liner. Ideal for when you want to throw it into your backpack, this liner protects the Steam Deck without the need for a hard case or its bulkiness. The perfect option for gamers on the go! Revamped internals With the new Steam Deck OLED, we’ve upgraded our systems to deliver a gaming powerhouse with extended gaming time and super-smooth gameplay. Enjoy long gaming sessions thanks to the OLED display’s increased energy efficiency and its larger battery boasting 30-50% more battery life. Plus, the high-performance AMD APU ensures your games run seamlessly without interruptions. Faster downloads Experience lightning-fast downloads with this console’s integrated Wi-Fi 6E technology. Equipped with increased bandwidth and lower latency, this console provides up to 3 times faster download speeds and steady online play. Better touch-screen The touchscreen polling rate has been updated to 180Hz, improving its responsiveness and accuracy. Every touch or gesture is detected with precision for more fluid, fast-paced gameplay. Plus, with redesigned analog sticks, delivering precision and comfort, your gaming interactions will soar to new heights. High-performance storage Secure the necessary built-in storage with a high-speed 1TB NVMe SSD. If you need more space, expand your internal storage by using a microSD card and load it with additional games. Lighter, cooler Weighing 30g less than the LCD model, thanks to the lighter screen, the Steam Deck OLED enhances the overall gaming experience. The bigger fan and updated thermals also mean this gaming console runs cooler.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e1TB NVMe SSD\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e1280 x 800 HDR OLED display with premium anti-glare etched glass, 7.4\" Diagonal display size up to 90Hz refresh rate\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWi-Fi 6E\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e50Whr battery; 3-12 hours of gameplay (content-dependent)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCarrying case with removable liner\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExclusive startup movie\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExclusive virtual keyboard theme\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Valve","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44659499696350,"sku":"","price":1000.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1704925264529.jpg?v=1704925639"},{"product_id":"valve-steam-deck-oled-512gb","title":"Valve Steam Deck OLED - 512GB","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStunning HDR OLED display Immerse yourself in the gaming world with the HDR OLED display revealing brighter whites and richer blacks. Designed for gaming enthusiasts, the striking contrast, brilliant clarity, and larger screen size redefine your gameplay, bringing vivid colors and motion to life. Anti-glare technology The 512GB model features anti-glare etched glass, setting a new level of eye comfort for gamers. The game seamlessly in both bright and dim lighting without distracting glares and reflections. Adding a layer of sophistication to the device, the glass provides a premium touch to your gaming sessions. Bonus carrying case The 1TB models come bundled with a carrying case that features a removable liner. Ideal for when you want to throw it into your backpack, this liner protects the Steam Deck without the need for a hard case or its bulkiness. The perfect option for gamers on the go! Revamped internals With the new Steam Deck OLED, we’ve upgraded our systems to deliver a gaming powerhouse with extended gaming time and super-smooth gameplay. Enjoy long gaming sessions thanks to the OLED display’s increased energy efficiency and its larger battery boasting 30-50% more battery life. Plus, the high-performance AMD APU ensures your games run seamlessly without interruptions. Faster downloads Experience lightning-fast downloads with this console’s integrated Wi-Fi 6E technology. Equipped with increased bandwidth and lower latency, this console provides up to 3 times faster download speeds and steady online play. Better touch-screen The touchscreen polling rate has been updated to 180Hz, improving its responsiveness and accuracy. Every touch or gesture is detected with precision for more fluid, fast-paced gameplay. Plus, with redesigned analog sticks, delivering precision and comfort, your gaming interactions will soar to new heights. High-performance storage Secure the necessary built-in storage with a high-speed 512GB NVMe SSD. If you need more space, expand your internal storage by using a microSD card and load it with additional games. Lighter, cooler Weighing 30g less than the LCD model, thanks to the lighter screen, the Steam Deck OLED enhances the overall gaming experience. The bigger fan and updated thermals also mean this gaming console runs cooler.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e512GB NVMe SSD\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e1280 x 800 HDR OLED display with premium anti-glare etched glass, 7.4\" Diagonal display size up to 90Hz refresh rate\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWi-Fi 6E\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e50Whr battery; 3-12 hours of gameplay (content-dependent)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCarrying case with removable liner\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExclusive startup movie\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExclusive virtual keyboard theme\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Valve","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44659515523294,"sku":"","price":